        <h1>Estimate Your Tax, <em>Nothing Uploaded</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain guide to figuring your 2026 US tax: why your top bracket is not the rate you actually pay, whether you will get a refund or owe, how self-employment and quarterly taxes work, and why the IRS itself now warns about online tax calculators. The Best Answer Hub Tax Calculator runs entirely in your browser.</p>
