          <li>IRS, <a href="https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/how-to-spot-fake-tax-deduction-calculators-exploiting-the-new-tax-law-under-the-one-big-beautiful-bill" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">How to spot fake tax deduction calculators</a> (be cautious with your financial data; use only official, trusted sources), March 2026.</li>
